      "createdAt": "2026-10-07T11:00:00Z",
      "endedAt": "2026-10-07T11:05:00Z",
      "numActiveParticipants": 0,
      "numParticipants": 2,
      "roomName": "demo",
      "sessionId": "RM_1"
    }
  ]
}
-- want-get --
┌────────────┬──────┬──────────────────────┬──────────────────────┬──────────────┬────────────────────┬───────────┐
│ Session ID │ Room │ Start                │ End                  │ Participants │ Connection Minutes │ Bandwidth │
├────────────┼──────┼──────────────────────┼──────────────────────┼──────────────┼────────────────────┼───────────┤
│ RM_1       │ demo │ 2026-10-07T11:00:00Z │ 2026-10-07T11:05:00Z │ 1            │ -                  │ -         │
└────────────┴──────┴──────────────────────┴──────────────────────┴──────────────┴────────────────────┴───────────┘
┌──────────┬──────┬──────────────────────┬──────────────────────┬─────────┬────────────┬───────┐
│ Identity │ Name │ Joined               │ Left                 │ Region  │ Connection │ SDK   │
├──────────┼──────┼──────────────────────┼──────────────────────┼─────────┼────────────┼───────┤
│ agent    │ -    │ 2026-10-07T11:00:01Z │ 2026-10-07T11:05:00Z │ us-east │ udp        │ 1.2.3 │
└──────────┴──────┴──────────────────────┴──────────────────────┴─────────┴────────────┴───────┘
-- want-note --
API-key analytics is deprecated: sign in once with `lk cloud auth --user-auth`, then run the same command with `--user-auth`
Using project [one]
-- want-note-quiet --
API-key analytics is deprecated: sign in once with `lk cloud auth --user-auth`, then run the same command with `--user-auth`
-- want-note-staging --
API-key analytics is deprecated: sign in once with `lk cloud auth --user-auth --public-api-url http://staging.test`, then run the same command with `--user-auth`
-- want-user-auth-stderr --
Using user [dev@example.com] on [http://publicapi.test]
Using project [one]
-- want-requests --
GET http://cloudapi.test/api/project/p_1/sessions apikey=APIone
GET http://cloudapi.test/api/project/p_1/sessions apikey=APIone
GET http://cloudapi.test/api/project/p_1/sessions/RM_1 apikey=APIone
GET http://cloudapi.test/api/project/p_1/sessions apikey=APIone
GET http://cloudapi.test/api/project/p_1/sessions/RM_1 apikey=APIone
GET http://publicapi.test/v0/projects/p_1/sessions bearer=st_1 project=p_1
GET http://publicapi.test/v0/projects/p_1/sessions/RM_1 bearer=st_1 project=p_1
GET http://cloudapi.test/api/project/p_1/sessions apikey=APIone
